<title>NETHERLANDS: Kleinwort Benson initiates OPG as Buy.</title>
<headline>Kleinwort Benson initiates OPG as Buy.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summary of March 4 research.</p>
<p>    Company---Sector-------------Price------Broker----------</p>
<p>    OPG	 Drugs wholesaling  54.00	Kleinwort Benson</p>
<p>COMMENT: BUY. OPG's valuation is poor reflection of its market positions and growth potential, its product pipeline and earnings power. Strong rebound in 1998/99 earnings seen of 19 pct, based on 20 pct headcount reduction in wholesaling, higher generics and medical profits and strong volume growth. Dutch drug prices law depressed share price performance. OPG has underperformed local AEX index by 20 pct, but sum-of-the-parts valuation indicates 40 pct undervaluation of the shares.</p>
<p>    Estimates (NLG):  EPS	 P/E     P/CF   Dividend</p>
<p>    1995/96 (actual)  4.90	11.1    7.5    1.90</p>
<p>    1996/97	     4.30	12.6    8.1    1.90</p>
<p>    1997/98	     4.70	11.6    7.5    2.00</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom, +31 20 504 5000 (Fax +31 20 504 5040)</p>
